    <string name="settings_title">Settings</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_swipe_title">Auto-swipe to map while driving</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_swipe_body">When you get in a vehicle the bottom screen jumps to the minimap tab. When you get out it goes back to the tab you were on. Needs the mirror running to show anything.</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_mirror_title">Start the mirror automatically</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_mirror_body">On the map tab, launch the screen-capture permission prompt as soon as the connection is live, so you don\'t have to tap start. Android still asks every time it starts a new session.</string>
    <string name="settings_always_return_hud_title">Always return to the HUD when you get out</string>
    <string name="settings_always_return_hud_body">When you step out of a vehicle, go back to the HUD tab no matter which tab you were on. Overrides the default (which only pulls you back if you\'re still looking at the map).</string>
    <string name="map_driving_to">driving to</string>
    <string name="settings_controls_side_title">Map controls on the right</string>
    <string name="settings_controls_side_body">Move the map\'s lock, reset, pin and stop icons to the right of the mirror. Default puts them on the left. The map stays centered and keeps the same breathing room on the free side.</string>
    <string name="settings_section_minimap">Minimap</string>
    <string name="settings_section_plugin">Plugin</string>
    <string name="settings_section_cheats">Cheats</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_reapply_cheats_title">Re-apply toggles on reconnect</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_reapply_cheats_body">After the companion reconnects (new session, game relaunch), turn back on any toggle you had enabled last time, plus any one-shot you long-pressed to arm. Only fires once per connection and only when the game is in a safe state (not paused, not switching characters, not in a cutscene).</string>
    <string name="settings_clear_cheats_title">Clear saved cheats</string>
    <string name="settings_clear_cheats_body">Forget every toggle you had turned on and every one-shot you had long-pressed for auto-apply. The next reconnect starts from a clean slate. The auto-re-apply switch above is left alone.</string>
    <string name="settings_clear_cheats_button">Clear</string>
    <string name="snackbar_cheats_cleared">Saved cheats cleared</string>
    <string name="settings_show_tips_title">Show tips again</string>
    <string name="settings_show_tips_body">Re-open the first-visit sheets on the HUD and the cheats tab the next time you visit them.</string>
    <string name="settings_show_tips_button">Show</string>
    <string name="settings_reconnect_title">Reconnect to the plugin</string>
    <string name="settings_reconnect_body">Force a fresh connection to ThorBridge. Use if \"not connected\" sticks on a weapon switch and does not clear on its own.</string>
